  <emu-host-law clause="sec-weakset-objects" class="nonfunctional">Access time: a cost, not a result.</emu-host-law>
  <emu-host-law clause="sec-weakset-objects" para="1" sent="2" class="scope">Means to observe a weak collection's contents an implementation might add lie outside the base layer.</emu-host-law>
